    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two police officers have taken their own lives within hours of each other. Is foul play involved? Can you crack the case in this 3rd installment of the Case Files series?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe suspects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort through evidence to discern truth from lies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find contradictions in suspect interviews.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve mini puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your partner in the interview room.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make key decisions that will alter the outcome of the case. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay to unlock multiple endings and alternate interview clips.</p></li></ul>",
